                <pb facs="0195" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg189"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Prince Cantacuzene.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-03"><hi rendition="#italic">May 3,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to the minister of Russia, and
                    has the honor to request that Prince Cantaeuzene will have the kindness to call
                    at the Department of State to-morrow morning, at 10.30 o’clock, for the purpose
                    of signing, with the Secretary of State, the proposed agreement for a modus
                    vivendi between the United States and Russia in relation to the fur-seal
                    fisheries in Bering Sea and the North Pacific Ocean.</p>
            </div>
